README.md
    7→Sync and Async Object-oriented Python SDK for the 3x-ui API.
    17→[![GitHub release (latest SemVer)](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/iwatkot/py3xui)](https://github.com/iwatkot/py3xui/releases)
